{"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1229989496874022", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1253288064544165"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2318862968913477"}]}, "change_log": "\"Hollow Atlas 0.6.2: refreshed lobby, improved level transitions and return-to-lobby buttons, proximity voice improvements, multiplayer cosmetic visibility fixes, and updated branding. Paid Points purchases remain disabled.\"", "created_date": 1791564594, "id": "1259874087218896", "version": "0.6.2", "version_code": 11, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1229989496874022", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1253288064544165"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2318862968913477"}]}, "change_log": "HOLLOW ATLAS 0.6.0 - Beyond the Windmill\r\n\r\nExplore rebuilt Poolrooms and Sewers, then discover a strange dreamhouse neighborhood, a watched grassland and the quiet Pinkrooms. Follow connected slides and hidden ballpit passages through six levels.\r\n\r\n- Revised arrival lobby, Mall storefronts and themed bundle displays.\r\n- Long trailing serpent, sewer rat and new dreamland creatures with distinct animation and sound.\r\n- Updated climbing, palm-driven swimming, slide braking and wrist movement.\r\n- Six discoverable rewards: a working windmill, Verity ball pet, cheese backpack, miniature dreamhouse, little watcher pet and tethered balloon.\r\n- Galaxy and Alien Tech cosmetics, including a folding visor and harmless orb projector.\r\n- Clearer unlock/equip controls and saved reward ownership and equipment.\r\n- Improved admin book controls and cross-world teleport/bring handling.\r\n- Revised lighting, reflections and world collision details.\r\n\r\nPaid Points purchases remain unavailable pending platform approval. No purchase is required to explore the levels and unlock their discovery rewards.", "created_date": 1791392315, "id": "1256594350880203", "version": "0.6.0", "version_code": 9, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1229989496874022", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1253288064544165"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2318862968913477"}]}, "change_log": "\"Version 0.5.0: Three connected expeditions: distant windmill forest, Poolrooms and the five-button sewer escape. Rebuilt mall and tree passage, revised climbing/swimming and controller alignment, fixed wrist twisting, new cosmetic bundles and voice expressions, refreshed ambience and app artwork. Paid Points checkout remains unavailable; owner-gifted Points and gameplay rewards remain usable. Headset comfort and frame rate require device validation.\"", "created_date": 1791219236, "id": "1253288064544165", "version": "0.5.0", "version_code": 8, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}